Genociding lots of monsters already makes the game hard. The more
nasties are genocided, the better the chance of an un-genocideable
archon showing up to ruin your day on the elemental planes.

I've never had a shortage of genocide scrolls. Having one is enough to
write several more with a magic marker. Alternatively, collecting
enough scrolls makes polypiling for any given scroll trivial. Allowing
two scrolls of genocide to do the work of one would be an
inconvenience rather than a significant change.




